    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508610/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1709177545\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508610/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1709177545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508610/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1709177545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>You are in a spaceship, alone. And your ship is dangerously close to a black hole. What were you doing there? What happened to the crew?</i><br><br>Estelaroid is a science fiction-themed escape room that will put your brain to the test, subjecting it to a wide variety of puzzles that you'll have to solve to discover the mysteries that surround the ship. Decipher the riddles, discover new rooms and try to repair it to survive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508610/extras/1f314884e7d48954088da5d96cb1c930.poster.avif?t=1709177545\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508610/extras/1f314884e7d48954088da5d96cb1c930.webm?t=1709177545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508610/extras/1f314884e7d48954088da5d96cb1c930.mp4?t=1709177545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your ship is getting closer to the black hole. Will you be able to solve the mysteries?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve the puzzles</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Discover new rooms and Items</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find out the mysteries that surround your ship</li></ul>",
